# SCM syntax highlighting & preventing 3-way merges
Cargo.lock merge=binary linguist-generated=true

# Generated by `core/tests/perf_baseline.rs` on every bless, and compared against a
# freshly-rendered string by the same test. Without this the Windows runner checks it out with
# CRLF and the comparison fails on a file whose content is identical -- which it did, on every
# Windows leg, until #380's check learned to normalise. Pinning the committed bytes to LF is
# the half of that fix which does not depend on the test remembering to normalise.
book/src/development/baseline-tables.md text eol=lf
